     "noAuthentication": false,
     "description": "List VAC detection events",
     "longDescription": "Returns the detection events of the VAC DDoS protection, with their start and end dates and attack vectors when available. Filter by date range, region or subnet. Ongoing events, not finished, can be requested on their own.",
